  "htmlContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>A strong feeling is a place to begin</title><style>@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.letter{padding-left:24px!important;padding-right:24px!important}.title{font-size:32px!important}.outer{padding:16px 8px!important}}</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#e8dedf;color:#302731\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all\">A writing practice for exploring intuition, fear, and what we want to believe.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#e8dedf\"><tr><td class=\"outer\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 16px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fcf9f4;border-collapse:collapse\">\n<tr><td style=\"height:6px;background:#653c56;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"letter\" style=\"padding:40px 48px 24px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#744b65\">WRITING · TAROT · SPIRITUAL REFLECTION</p><p style=\"margin:0;font:32px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#302731\">Letters from Kali</p><div style=\"height:1px;background:#d9ccd2;margin:24px 0 28px\"></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#744b65\">ON DISCERNMENT · LETTER 01</p><h1 class=\"title\" style=\"margin:0;font:normal 38px/1.15 Georgia,serif;color:#653c56\">A strong feeling is a place to begin.</h1></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"letter\" style=\"padding:0 48px 40px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Sometimes you feel something before you have words for it.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">A hesitation. A pull toward something. A sense that a conversation needs another question.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Then comes the wondering: Is this intuition? Fear? Something I want to believe?</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">You don’t have to answer immediately.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Discernment can begin with giving an impression your attention while leaving its meaning open. Writing offers a place to do that—to notice what you felt before the explanations begin.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0;background:#efe5d6;border-left:3px solid #744b65\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#744b65\">A MOMENT ON THE PAGE</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Try finishing these four sentences:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">What I noticed was…</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">The meaning I gave it was…</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">What I hope—or fear—is…</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">What I can actually check is…</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Keep your first observation separate from your interpretation. “My stomach tightened” and “This person is dishonest” are different statements. The first describes an experience; the second needs examination.</p><p style=\"margin:28px 0;font:italic 26px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:#653c56\">You can listen to yourself and still ask questions.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">For this week, choose one small impression. Write it down, leave room for uncertainty, and return to it later.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">What do you notice when you give yourself that space? You’re welcome to reply.</p><p style=\"margin:30px 0 0;font:italic 30px Georgia,serif;color:#653c56\">Kali</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"letter\" style=\"padding:26px 48px;background:#f5f0e8;border-top:1px solid #d9ccd2;text-align:center;font:12px/1.8 Arial,sans-serif;color:#655b61\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">Randi Agency</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">11265 Hallett Street, Soddy Daisy, TN 37379</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">You&#x27;ve received it because you&#x27;ve subscribed to our newsletter.</p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0\"><a href=\"{{ unsubscribe }}\" style=\"color:#653c56;text-decoration:underline\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
